{"id":51649,"date":"2026-06-14T07:01:23","date_gmt":"2026-06-14T06:01:23","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=51649"},"modified":"2026-09-20T14:11:52","modified_gmt":"2026-09-20T13:11:52","slug":"nac-trail","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/nac-trail\/","title":{"rendered":"NAC Trail 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">NAC Trail 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>NAC Trail 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no dia <strong>27 de Setembro de 2026<\/strong> no concelho de <strong>Oliveira de Azem\u00e9is<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Aveiro<\/strong>. Organizado pelo din\u00e2mico <strong>N\u00facleo de Atletismo de Cucuj\u00e3es (NAC)<\/strong> em estreita parceria com o Munic\u00edpio de Oliveira de Azem\u00e9is, o evento pontua oficialmente para o Circuito Distrital de Trail Running da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Aveiro.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Com partida e chegada no apraz\u00edvel <strong>Parque Urbano de Oliveira de Azem\u00e9is<\/strong>, as provas arrancam \u00e0s <strong>09:30<\/strong> para o <strong>Trail Sprint de 17 km (700m D+)<\/strong> e para o <strong>Mini Trail de 10 km (350m D+)<\/strong>, seguindo-se \u00e0s <strong>09:35<\/strong> a <strong>Caminhada de 10 km<\/strong>. O tra\u00e7ado percorre trilhos florestais densos e linhas de \u00e1gua buc\u00f3licas da regi\u00e3o, oferecendo aos atletas uma imers\u00e3o na natureza com abastecimentos completos e total seguran\u00e7a.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o contempla t-shirt t\u00e9cnica oficial alusiva \u00e0 prova, seguro desportivo, cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica por chip e pr\u00e9mios para os melhores classificados individuais e coletivos.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-w